{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae8d349a9b94fb6c253e8f3140cf8af0afe1c6dea308257adb22ba2fe4eb0c7e", "ja": "（年末年始は芸能界の書き入れ時！\nみんなのためなら大晦日の残業だって気合いが……）", "zh": "（年末年初可是演艺界最忙的时候！\n为了大家，就算是除夕加班也要打起精神……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "606a82e77af85017bb5a302425630d15f57d22b6024bc4ea900f3d29a39705db", "ja": "{$P$}。張り切るのもいいですけど、\n適度な休憩も必要ですよ。これ、どうぞ。", "zh": "{$P$}。干劲十足是好事，不过，适当休息也是必要的。这个，给您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "37f39dcbca5942bdf6dd231cb618d881d20009395bfd4a171e834686cffa8fbf", "ja": "おお、律子。ありがとう。大丈夫……ふあ。\n……そうだな、少し休憩を入れるか。", "zh": "哦，律子。谢谢。没事……哈啊。\n……也是，该稍微休息一下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_1003", "source_sha256": "42165220946f6e645876e955ecd241bd22c1359479d2b647ce835ce4f84228e1", "ja": "コーヒーを受け取る", "zh": "接过咖啡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2000_009rit", "source_sha256": "daa525951e7ad01a0a4255c2e889d6bf8f1ef6ba0f05dbb294c7d2de6d2dd159", "ja": "もうすぐ日付も変わりますしね。\n年越しの瞬間くらい、少しゆっくりしましょう。", "zh": "马上就要跨年了。\n至少在辞旧迎新的这一刻，稍微放松一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2001_p", "source_sha256": "9e0ca78f102bde75156a82769e27368a77ad927e322c505d8e19a0213379010c", "ja": "もうそんな時間か。集中してて気づかなかった……。\nつきあわせてごめんな。手伝ってくれてありがとう。", "zh": "已经这个时间了吗。太投入了都没注意到……\n抱歉拉着你陪我。谢谢你帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2002_009rit", "source_sha256": "349c88c921c77e63bd43ebceadb5801199abb09a4e1e9d5c81e8e207e4279a50", "ja": "ふふ、{$P$}ひとりに\n無理をさせるわけにはいきませんからね。", "zh": "呵呵，不能让{$P$}先生一个人勉强撑着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2003_009rit", "source_sha256": "6e9ef351765b3ca4993fa044d1ab5a77e3f069c2e680d63e9ce307d71df80214", "ja": "それに、ありがたいじゃないですか。大晦日も\nバタバタしなきゃいけないほど、お仕事があるなんて。", "zh": "而且，这不是件值得感谢的事吗？居然忙到连除夕都得手忙脚乱，工作多得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2004_p", "source_sha256": "20cf93ed7b82c76317fd086a843110c734bf21d0a16e19b48099d65d39571d26", "ja": "そうだな。まあアイドルの律子に\n夜中まで手伝ってもらうのはどうかと思うけど……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，让身为偶像的律子帮忙到半夜，我觉得还是不太妥当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2005_009rit", "source_sha256": "225dcc3168da5aa3931ff87c815f0a2fd0d99dfa0049594e60bed9b52f7d16f6", "ja": "気にしないでください。巡り巡って、このお仕事が\n自分にも、みんなにも繋がるわけですし……それに。", "zh": "请别在意。兜兜转转，这份工作也会和我、和大家联系在一起……而且。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2006_009rit", "source_sha256": "5e4e1260e9043296322a1f282a6255875736f68e08a43b7803e199f74b02fa17", "ja": "私、好きなんです。{$P$}と\nこうして一緒に、お仕事する時間。", "zh": "我很喜欢的。和{$P$}\n像这样一起工作的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2007_p", "source_sha256": "24c771c2647195c6fa2105ec36f2358b809981c06307a50934ea8792fc9d0942", "ja": "そうなのか？　それは初耳だな。", "zh": "原来如此？这我还是第一次听说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2008_009rit", "source_sha256": "946b9fac9d493fb2aed01b4ee47494f160855f4ab72bbc6ae9a4f69e1813598e", "ja": "なんていうか、落ち着くんです。\n{$P$}と一緒にいると。", "zh": "该怎么说呢，和{$P$}待在一起时，会让人觉得很安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2009_009rit", "source_sha256": "d4843303ac69916b77ce19083fd7b499a52583e5e03f90c59a54172ffe550985", "ja": "居心地がいいっていうか……大晦日に劇場に\n来ることにしたのも、それが理由だったりしますし。", "zh": "或者说是让人感到很舒心吧……大年三十\n决定来剧场，这也是原因之一呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2010_009rit", "source_sha256": "3c4ccb5a80b8bb3cc5f5cb8c0ad70135c87b3a02e2d1f3340fde8b19aa1b752d", "ja": "{$P$}となら、\nいい気持ちで年越しができそうだな……って。", "zh": "和{$P$}一起的话，感觉就能心情舒畅地跨年了……屹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2011_p", "source_sha256": "fbb9d01f633825b8282fc0495c422af323a86e8303534ee4ce447159db549f88", "ja": "そんな風に思ってくれてたのか。\nなんというか、プロデューサー冥利に尽きるな。", "zh": "原来你一直这么想啊。\n该说不愧是当制作人的幸福吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2012_p", "source_sha256": "8387cd92783d2f30f5cfae3a2262c93d36b2e3d80d251bb92f849f33490c0e06", "ja": "けど、それは俺も同じだよ。一年の終わりと始まりを\n律子と過ごせるのは、すごく幸せだと思うしな。", "zh": "不过，我也是一样的。能和律子一起度过一年的结束和开始，\n我觉得真的很幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2013_009rit", "source_sha256": "24f1ed5b758dd39bd50c299bcfea0fc53692989f8897292cfba62e598b9643b6", "ja": "そ……そうですか？　なんだか照れますね。\nま、同じようなことを、私も言いましたけど……。", "zh": "是……是吗？总觉得有点不好意思呢。\n不过，我之前也说过类似的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2014_009rit", "source_sha256": "09eba46ab0e973b9516b00b939c4a1942332e4d6d7df85b4fb956b5f5045160c", "ja": "あっ！　な、なーんて言ってたら、\nそろそろカウントダウンが始まるみたいですよ！", "zh": "啊！我、我正说着这个呢，\n好像差不多要开始倒计时了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2015_p", "source_sha256": "d9d22e81368b9d868225efdbdb23844617741a841cfa00fcbf83945c81edf25d", "ja": "本当だ。じゃあ、年が変わる前に……律子、今年も\n一年ありがとう。来年も、よろしく頼むな！", "zh": "真的。那就在新年到来前……律子，今年也谢谢你一年来的努力。\n明年也拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0374_2016_009rit", "source_sha256": "47edfc47f7b6ee653ef690553d69e2cb10968f5b95aa947016714eac7aa5a387", "ja": "ふふっ、こちらこそ！　今年以上の名プロデュース、\n期待してますよ？　{$P$}殿♪", "zh": "呵呵，我才要谢谢你！期待您明年的制作能更上一层楼哦？{$P$}大人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
